  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></math></p><p>The expression for the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>component of the force can be calculated as follows: </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence, at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, the value of the force is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
